 r←Test_Misc_025(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;successFlag;msg
⍝ Exercise `PerformConfigChecks`: an incomplete "=" definition is invalid.
⍝ Used to throw a LENGTH ERROR out of `PerformConfigChecks` because such a definition
⍝ partitions into a single part, not two.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 ⍝ Nothing to the right of the "="
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev='
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢msg

 ⍝ Nothing to the left of the "="
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks ∆GetConfigForChecks'=TestCases'
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf 0<≢msg

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
